# Saved prompts

Prompts you want to replay. Instead of retyping the same instructions, save one here
and say **"run the <name> prompt"** - the agent fetches just that section and runs it.

This file is yours; edit it by hand whenever you like. Two rules keep it readable:

1. Every prompt starts with a `## Name` heading at the start of a line. Pick a name
   you would actually say out loud - that is what gets searched.
2. The `> summary:` line directly under the heading is the index. Everything after
   it is the prompt itself, and may call other skills.

```markdown
## Daily standup notes
> summary: Summarise yesterday's commits and open PRs into standup notes.
<!-- tags: daily, git -->

Look at my commits since yesterday morning and my open PRs, and write three
bullet points: done, doing, blocked.
```

